        <h3>Windham — 4-5 dispensaries</h3>
        <p>Route 302 'Green Mile' corridor. The region's largest and most established cannabis market. Maine's Alternative Caring, JAR Cannabis Co., Alternative Essence. Commercial rents $14-18/sq ft.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="town-card">
        <h3>Bridgton — 3-4 dispensaries</h3>
